{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/3f260aa5dd34155d8adb475608eba516.avif?t=1773000256\" width=760 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/30c73c3819689a63a74a704e6562d838.webp?t=1773000256\" width=391 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026there was a <strong>hero</strong> entering a dungeon, like so many did before them. But this one - <strong>you!</strong> - is not up for murder. They're looking for a <strong>job</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mops &amp; Mobs</strong> is set in the bowels of a <strong>multi-level labyrinth</strong> where you\u2019re going to meet monsters in <strong>critical moments</strong> of their lives - as the dungeon recently was inherited by a new owner who doesn\u2019t quite know what he\u2019s doing. But it\u2019s not just the dungeon\u2019s <strong>master who is struggling ...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Befriend a cast of charmingly unhinged monsters</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/2f7e497f627abb0aa3fe50f6eb11574c.poster.avif?t=1773000256\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/2f7e497f627abb0aa3fe50f6eb11574c.webm?t=1773000256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>lich lady</strong> lamenting her past, a<strong> gelatinous cube</strong> befallen by an existential crisis, the <strong>prison guard</strong> longing for immortality - even the <strong>bridge troll</strong> is being kept from his purpose\u2026\u00a0<strong>Talk </strong>to the monsters, <strong>get to know them</strong>, <strong>find out</strong> what troubles them and <strong>help </strong>where you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore a retro-styled dungeon in a juicy dungeon crawler manner</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/e6740d2ac35d744b35b4bd2e91001f4a.poster.avif?t=1773000256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/e6740d2ac35d744b35b4bd2e91001f4a.webm?t=1773000256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is not your enemy -\u00a0 <strong>it\u2019s your workplace</strong>. <strong>Explore </strong>your new home from the greasy kitchen, the ancient library, <span class=\"bb_strike\">the gold hoard</span> the place where they do the bookkeeping, to the spooky graveyard, the hidden corridors, the fiery forge and all the other places where <strong>adventurers usually go to die</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Clean, repair, and redecorate rooms for monsters and vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/b32d0429f692684f7c0fa62311811407.poster.avif?t=1773000256\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/b32d0429f692684f7c0fa62311811407.webm?t=1773000256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/b32d0429f692684f7c0fa62311811407.mp4?t=1773000256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear </strong>dirt heaps full of critters, <strong>learn</strong> each monster\u2019s decoration style, and make the dungeon a better place for everyone. Even adventurers appreciate a <strong>well-maintained torture device</strong> from time to time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover the secret of a forgotten war like a detective </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/fa032c6706fba86f2308245570bf2883.poster.avif?t=1773000256\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/fa032c6706fba86f2308245570bf2883.webm?t=1773000256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon master may deny it, but something is very wrong. <strong>A conspiracy</strong> is forming in the shadows and beyond. <strong>Investigate</strong> in <strong>detective manner</strong>: <strong>interrogate</strong>,<strong> find evidence</strong>, <strong>solve </strong>puzzles, <strong>combine </strong>clues and <strong>decipher </strong>hidden symbols.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight with collectible cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/b4845a1780cfa02241fe9c2727e3afdb.poster.avif?t=1773000256\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/b4845a1780cfa02241fe9c2727e3afdb.webm?t=1773000256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone plays cards</strong> in the dungeon. The monsters, adventurers, rats and even dirt heaps! Is it less bloody? Perhaps! <strong>Less deadly? Not. At. All!</strong> <strong>Help </strong>monsters in order to <strong>gain special cards</strong> and build a deck to have the upper hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Enjoy the twist on a beloved setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/0b9d81402b991150edec9cf1932399b9.avif?t=1773000256\" alt=\"\"width=760 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mops &amp; Mobs delivers <strong>office humour meets role-playing narratives\u00a0</strong>- while taking its cast <strong>very serious</strong>. Take a look behind the scenes of a dungeon business, where monsters are your <strong>co-workers</strong> and adventurers your <strong>customers</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2851050?t=1773000256","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/95710d9f8d6215c19faaeecdb8eed82bcc42c841/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773000256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/d695a2e4a9b3e8f4bf1790321630e08fc77a8de4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773000256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/d695a2e4a9b3e8f4bf1790321630e08fc77a8de4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773000256","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3064340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class