.webm?t=1773000256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone plays cards</strong> in the dungeon. The monsters, adventurers, rats and even dirt heaps! Is it less bloody? Perhaps! <strong>Less deadly? Not. At. All!</strong> <strong>Help </strong>monsters in order to <strong>gain special cards</strong> and build a deck to have the upper hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Enjoy the twist on a beloved setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/0b9d81402b991150edec9cf1932399b9.avif?t=1773000256\" alt=\"\"width=760 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mops &amp; Mobs delivers <strong>office humour meets role-playing narratives\u00a0</strong>- while taking its cast <strong>very serious</strong>. Take a look behind the scenes of a dungeon business, where monsters are your <strong>co-workers</strong> and adventurers your <strong>customers</strong>.</p>","developers":["Rat King Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/141495912e699efe7a033626d8b63c76a8f29cdf/header.jpg?t=1773000256","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved \u00a9 Rat King Entertainment GbR","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU, ARMv7 or ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics with full Vulkan 1.2 support</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux